## Commercial License

A commercial license is available for organizations that:
- Want to embed OTTO in proprietary SaaS products
- Cannot comply with AGPL's open-source requirements
- Need additional support, indemnification, or custom terms

### Trucking Exception

The commercial license includes a perpetual, royalty-free, worldwide grant for:

> "Use solely in connection with the ownership, operation, dispatch, routing,
> maintenance, compliance, or insurance of motor vehicles operated by the
> licensee or its affiliates."

This means trucking companies (from owner-operators to mega-fleets) can use OTTO
commercially without licensing fees. The AGPL network-service provisions do not
apply to internal fleet operations.

### Who Needs a Commercial License?

| Use Case | License Required |
|----------|------------------|
| Trucking fleet (internal use) | Free (AGPL + Trucking Exception) |
| Self-hosted by motor carrier | Free (AGPL + Trucking Exception) |
| SaaS vendor embedding OTTO | Commercial License |
| Platform reselling OTTO features | Commercial License |
| Offering OTTO as a service to third parties | Commercial License (or AGPL compliance) |

### Contact

For commercial licensing inquiries: licensing@artalis.io

